  "source_cause": "The original StepStatistics Banner.lua calls Banner.LoadFromSong on CurrentSongChanged. Native NotesLoaderSSC retains the explicit BANNER tag, Song.GetBannerPath resolves that declared file, and Banner.LoadFromSong loads the real image when Song.HasBanner is true. HOPE declares bannrt.png, an existing original182413-byte PNG. The retained candidate does not include it at all. Separately, owned create_song_table searches conventional filename stems banner/bn instead of receiving the real declared banner metadata, so adding the image alone would still miss its non-conventional filename. Owned Banner.LoadFromSong also lacks the native fallback branch when no valid banner is available. These source/input gaps leave its real Banner actor textureless at native sequence727.",
